# {{.Title}}

A Constellation bridge in Python. Write workflow results into your system in `apply()` and carry out
approved actions in `act()` (bridge.py). Its name and settings are in `connector.json`.

    pip install --require-hashes -r requirements.txt   # the released constellation-space, by hash
    pip install pytest && pytest
    constellation conformance -- python bridge.py      # against the mock
    CONSTELLATION_API_KEY=<a key with predictions:read> python bridge.py

On start it checks in; approve it on Integrations in Constellation. `CURSOR_FILE` (default cursor.txt) keeps
where it stopped. Build the image with `docker build -t {{.Name}} .`.
